        "slc_ee24a4f6fd0060322e400f0e8a633148d52df6d5a43ed15154055f25d715bd55"
      ],
      "text": "The action is bundled into a single dist/index.js with esbuild so no node_modules are needed at runtime; non-code Pi SDK assets are copied to dist/pi-sdk/ and resolved via the PI_PACKAGE_DIR environment variable."
    },
